  "dct_description_sm": [
    "<span style='text-indent:0px; text-decoration-style:initial; text-decoration-color:initial; display:inline !important;'>\n\n<div>A bear management area is a polygon feature that identifies a ministry-regulated boundary used to manage, administer and enforce the licensed black bear hunting tourism program.</div>\n\n<div><br /> </div>\n\n<br /><div><strong>Additional Documentation </strong></div>\n\n<div><ul>\n\n<li><a href='https://www.publicdocs.mnr.gov.on.ca/mirb/Bear%20Management%20Area%20-%20Documentation.docx' target='_blank' rel='nofollow ugc noopener noreferrer'>Bear Management Area - Documentation  (Word)</a><br /></li>\n\n<li><a href='https://www.publicdocs.mnr.gov.on.ca/mirb/Bear%20Management%20Area%20-%20Data%20Description.pdf' target='_blank' rel='nofollow ugc noopener noreferrer'>Bear Management Area - Data Description  (PDF)</a><br /></li>\n\n</ul></div>\n\n\n\n<div><br /></div>\n\n<div><strong>Status</strong><br /></div>\n\n<div>On going: Data is continually being updated<br /></div>\n\n<div><br /></div>\n\n<div><strong>Maintenance and Update Frequency</strong><br /></div>\n\n<div>Annually: Data is updated every year<br /></div>\n\n<div><br /></div>\n\n<div><strong>Contact</strong><br /></div>\n\n<div>Wildlife Section, <a href='mailto:wildlifepolicy@ontario.ca' target='_blank' rel='nofollow ugc noopener noreferrer'>wildlifepolicy@ontario.ca</a></div></span>"
